323
; Unison demo: the clip's x box = number of copies, all start together.
; The <caw> lines set p5 and p6 of every copy (p4 is set in the code), the code below uses them.
<caw>
{p: 5, from: 0, to: 1}
{p: 6, from: 400, +100}
</caw>
iAmp = 0.1
aEnv linen iAmp, 0.05, p3, 0.3
aOut oscili aEnv, p6
outs aOut * (1 - p5), aOut * p5
